From 4ea9874edd161b1374e2e9fe8fe6d96f5a1c69b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:57:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Camera tool: exact Camera[Pro] panel, canvas path and Camera
 Layer rules

New camera.js/camera.css (loaded after ui.js):
- option rows at the measured positions: label column, rounded drop downs,
  flat check boxes, padlock and wrench icons, steppers, X/Y with 2 decimals,
  values shown with their unit (0.00%, 0.00 deg, 66.67%)
- wrench buttons create/delete the key of that channel; Toggle all toggles
  every channel
- canvas with the Camera tool: motion path through the keys, green frame of
  the previous key, red frame of the next key, a ring on every other key,
  ring handle at the right end of the rotation guide
- Camera Layer: other tools are greyed out in the Main Panel and give
  "You cannot use this tool on a Camera Layer."; picking a layer returns to
  the Pen Brush
- timeline: the camera layer is one box from the first key to the clip end

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
